    "AI 从官网页面识别，链接均来自官网原文" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Identified by AI from the official page; all links come from the official text"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI が公式サイトのページから識別したもので、リンクはすべて公式サイトの原文に基づきます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 從官網頁面識別，連結均來自官網原文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 会重新分析官网，填写公演、票务、座位与周边字段，并独立保存结果。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI reanalyzes the official page, fills event, ticket, seating and goods fields, and saves the results separately."
